      "id": 313377391,
      "body": "I also tried this on a project I was working on. It was mildly helpful but Claude added several parts which had been discontinued to the BOM. I ended up contacting the manufacturer to find comprable versions. If you\u2019re ordering niche parts, it\u2019s definitely better to call the manufacturer because info online isn\u2019t always accurate.",
